   "source": [
    "### Interpretation\n",
    "\n",
    "- Higher SES is associated with higher overall AI literacy (standardized β = 0.209, HC3 p = 0.001, 95% CI [0.087, 0.330]).\n",
    "\n",
    "- The effect is small: SES explains approximately 4.4% of the variance in AI literacy. The Spearman estimate is similar (ρ = 0.215, p = 0.001), suggesting the result is not driven solely by the linear-model scale.\n",
    "\n",
    "-------"
