   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "med-heading",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Exploratory mediation analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "- The revised analysis estimates 12 simple mediation models: 2 SES factors × 3 retained mediators × 2 AI-literacy factors. Conceptual exposure and learning ecology remain in the scored dataset but are excluded from mediation, network, and hierarchical models.\n",
    "\n",
    "- Bootstrap confidence intervals use 5,000 resamples, followed by Benjamini-Hochberg correction, with Holm correction reported as a stricter sensitivity analysis.\n",
    "\n",
    "- This is a narrower specification. Mediator exclusion should be supported by theory or prespecification rather than chosen only because of earlier p-values."
   ]
  },
